NON-DISCLOSURE AGREEMENT (NDA)

This Agreement is entered into on the 29th day of June, 2025

BETWEEN

TechNova Solutions Pvt. Ltd., a company incorporated under the Companies
Act, 2013, with its registered office at 88 Silicon Valley, Bengaluru --
560100, India (hereinafter referred to as the "Disclosing Party")

AND

Mr. Arjun Mehta, residing at 12B, Andheri East, Mumbai -- 400069
(hereinafter referred to as the "Receiving Party")

WHEREAS:

1. The Disclosing Party possesses certain confidential and proprietary
information relating to a new AI-powered data analytics platform.

2. The Receiving Party agrees to receive and maintain the
confidentiality of the said information strictly for evaluation
purposes.

3. The Receiving Party shall not disclose or communicate the
confidential information to any third party without prior written
consent of the Disclosing Party.

4. This Agreement shall remain in effect for a period of 2 years from
the date of signing.

5. Any breach of this Agreement will entitle the Disclosing Party to
seek immediate injunctive relief along with any damages suffered.

6. All disputes shall be governed by and construed in accordance with
the laws of India and shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the courts
in Bengaluru.

IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the parties have executed this Agreement on the day
and year first above written.

